-- title:
--   Reduced cyclic algebras and nilpotency index one
-- statement:
--   Let K be a field and A a nontrivial commutative K-algebra. Let x be an element of A and z an element of K. Suppose every element of A is a polynomial in x with coefficients in K, and x-z is nilpotent.
--
--   Then A is reduced (has no nonzero nilpotent elements) if and only if x is the scalar z. Equivalently, A is reduced if and only if the nilpotency index of x-z is one.
--
--   Nontriviality means 1 is not 0 in A; it ensures that the nilpotency index of zero is one. No finite-dimensionality assumption or characteristic-zero restriction is imposed.
-- source:
--   Derived supporting algebra for the Senthil Kumar mission. Let A be a nontrivial commutative K-algebra generated by x, where K is a field and x-z is nilpotent. Then A is reduced exactly when x=z, equivalently when the nilpotency index of x-z is one. The argument needs no finite-dimensionality assumption or characteristic-zero restriction. This is inferred supporting algebra, not a separately quoted theorem from the source article. Pinned Mathlib revision 0df444a360eaa60ab8c11dca51a86af692955474: Polynomial.eval2_at_apply (Lean name eval₂_at_apply), IsNilpotent.map_iff, nilpotencyClass_eq_one and FaithfulSMul.algebraMap_injective. Primary documentation: https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/RingTheory/Nilpotent/Defs.html and https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Algebra/Polynomial/Eval/Defs.html . No new definitions or platform dependencies.

import Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Basic
import Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Eval.Algebra
import Mathlib.RingTheory.Nilpotent.Defs

open Polynomial

theorem WeierstrassEllipticZeta.polynomial_cyclic_reduced_iff_nilpotency_one
    (K A : Type*) [Field K] [CommRing A] [Algebra K A] [Nontrivial A]
    (x : A) (z : K)
    (hsurj : Function.Surjective (fun q : Polynomial K => q.eval₂ (algebraMap K A) x))
    (hnil : IsNilpotent (x - algebraMap K A z)) :
    (IsReduced A ↔ x = algebraMap K A z) ∧
      (IsReduced A ↔ nilpotencyClass (x - algebraMap K A z) = 1) := by sorry
